<title>USA: Health Management Associates buys hospital.</title>
<headline>Health Management Associates buys hospital.</headline>
<dateline>NAPLES, Fla. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Management Associates Inc said it has a definitive agreement to acquire Rankin Medical Center, a 112-bed general acute care hospital.</p>
<p>Health Management said it plans to increase the facility to 134 beds in January, 1997.  Closing on the transaction is expected effective January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
